<title>USA: Unisys Corp Q1 full results.</title>
<headline>Unisys Corp Q1 full results.</headline>
<dateline>BLUE BELL, Pa. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		     1996</p>
<p> Net shr (loss)  $0.06	 (loss)   $0.25</p>
<p> Net (profit)    19.3	  (loss)   13.4</p>
<p> Revs		1,530.7		  1,423.1</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  174,849		  171,437</p>
<p>(All data above in milions, except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: The company said its earnings were driven by strong results from the Computer Systems business and another solid performance from its Global Customer Service unit.</p>
<p>The company said operating income was $106.6 million versus 20.9 million.</p>
<p>Analyst consensus for the quarter loss was $0.14, according to First Call.</p>
</text>
